description=Samsung SM-S9180 legacy/HIDL driver paired with APK1130. Adds GET-only leased synchronized PCM immediately before and after PEQ, including instance, configuration and transition metadata. Retains all prior read-only monitors. No filter algorithm, script, saved parameter or audition changes. Install paired module and reboot once.
